    "mainIdea": {
      "text": "When the North Mountain alarm rope broke before a blizzard, Anna, Elsa, Ms. Lin, and 2 crossed a magical snow bridge to reach the bell tower. Because the bridge turned spoken directions into real paths, their different commands split it into dangerous routes. Anna’s haste and Elsa’s immediate rescue left them trapped instead of bringing them closer. On a stable platform, they changed their approach: each person reported one useful observation, and 2 confirmed the tower’s position. After everyone agreed on a single direction, the bridge carried them safely forward, while Elsa used her magic only to support their chosen route. At the tower, they followed another shared plan, waited for 2’s signal, struck the bell, and warned Arendelle in time."
